  "prefLabel": "Per-A 102.06 Classification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 102.06 “Classification” means the determination by the director of personnel of a position’s appropriate placement within the classification plan based upon the basic purpose, characteristic duties, distinguishing factors and minimum qualifications required for that position.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 100) #7377, eff 10-23-00",
